; Address of a location's name phrase
;
; Looks up the location record of location A (#R$9BB1) and returns the address
; of its first phrase code (record +2). For an id of $50 or more the lookup
; leaves IX alone and the result is not meaningful.
;
; A Location id
; O:HL Address of the phrase codes of the location
; O:IX Preserved
@label=LocationNamePtr
c$71D5 PUSH IX       ;
 $71D7 CALL $9BB1    ;
 $71DA PUSH IX       ;
 $71DC POP HL        ;
 $71DD INC HL        ;
 $71DE INC HL        ;
 $71DF POP IX        ;
 $71E1 RET           ;
